    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> is continuous on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mi>&#960;x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> Also</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munder><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Either <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;(reject)&nbsp;</p><p>from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>",
